<% IF !unlocked %>
<section class="academy-gate" aria-label="Academy chess entrance">
  <div class="academy-gate-heading"><span>♟️ OPENSTACK ACADEMY</span><span>Entrance challenge</span></div>
  <div class="academy-board-wrap">
    <div id="academy-chessboard" class="academy-chessboard" tabindex="-1" aria-label="Chessground chessboard"></div>
    <div id="academy-welcome" class="academy-welcome">
      <div class="academy-welcome-panel">
        <button id="academy-welcome-close" class="academy-welcome-close" type="button" aria-label="Close welcome message and reveal chessboard">×</button>
        <h1>Welcome to OpenStack Academy!</h1>
        <p class="academy-welcome-lead">Solve the chess challenge to earn your access key.</p>
        <p>Checkmate in 3 moves.</p>
        <p class="academy-welcome-help">Click X to reveal the chessboard and begin.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p><button id="academy-next-puzzle" type="button">Next puzzle →</button></p>
  <p id="academy-board-status" class="academy-board-status">Chessboard preview — puzzle validation and lesson unlocking are coming next.</p>
  <p class="academy-chess-credit">♟️ Powered by Chessground. Special thanks to the developers and contributors of <a href="https://lichess.org">Lichess</a>. GPL-3.0-or-later · <a href="https://github.com/lichess-org/chessground#readme">Original README</a> · <a href="https://github.com/lichess-org/chessground/blob/master/LICENSE">License</a> · <a href="https://github.com/bosnatron/chessground">Our fork</a> · <a href="https://github.com/bosnatron/OpenStack_Academy">Academy source</a>.</p>
</section>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@lichess-org/chessground@10.5.0/assets/chessground.base.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@lichess-org/chessground@10.5.0/assets/chessground.brown.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@lichess-org/chessground@10.5.0/assets/chessground.cburnett.css">
<script type="module" src="/js/academy-chess.js?v=academy-puzzle-selector-1"></script>

<% ELSE %>
<section class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Open-source technology education</p>
  <h1>Learn by building.</h1>
  <p>OpenStack Academy offers practical lessons in Linux, development, databases, and open-source tools.</p>
  <p class="motto">TIMTOWTDI — With Perl, hard jobs are possible.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="lessons-title">
  <h2 id="lessons-title">Start learning</h2>
  <ol class="lesson-list">
    <li><a href="/Step01"><strong>Linux installation</strong><span>Get started with Slackware Linux</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step02"><strong>Linux commands</strong><span>Explore the command line</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step03"><strong>Vim</strong><span>Edit text efficiently</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step04"><strong>Apache</strong><span>Understand web servers</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step05"><strong>MariaDB and MySQL</strong><span>Explore relational databases</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step06"><strong>Perl</strong><span>Learn a powerful programming language</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step07"><strong>CPAN</strong><span>Discover Perl's module ecosystem</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step08"><strong>Dancer2</strong><span>Build web applications in Perl</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="/Step09"><strong>Git and GitHub</strong><span>Track and share code</span></a></li>
  </ol>
</section>
<% END %>
